{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:432317fda8721a371b4ab889fbafc65a", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 15, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Corrected the row-count verification to check 6 total lines and 5 data lines separately. `migrate.sh` already generates the required header plus five plan-free user rows.\n\nVerified with:\n\n```sh\n./migrate.sh && bash verify.sh\n```\n\nSTATUS: success", "turn_key": "sha256:e7806bea1525a44ee7a5e397afc8a99a"}
